	<div class='notes-par'><span class='notes-field-wrap'><span class='notes-field' data-field='Detail' data-type='richtext' data-kind='editable'><p>■対象ファイル</p>
<p>FNFDB0950/FOTKFP　（T 納品報告）</p>
